1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,620
My only BMW — well, it's in the shop right now.

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:03,740
What, they still haven't fixed it?

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:08,020
No,… turns out today they found the right sensor's shot.

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,240
Otherwise they got everything else done.

5
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,280
Changed the pump, that's it.

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:18,100
I've got a right sensor in there that's not working,… it won't raise the clearance.

7
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:19,440
Ah, the suspension won't lift?

8
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,080
Ah, yeah, gotcha — there's this thing.

9
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,300
You can start it yourself.

10
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,000
Just gotta switch off the load first, right?

11
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:26,140
There, I turned it off, stopped it.

12
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,260
Yeah, see — it just shut down.

13
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:28,580
I mean, so now it won't start?

